{"schema":"meaning-model-understanding-note/v1","kind":"lens","text":"Fear or love. Is what {subject} does primarily out of fear or out of love?

Why: The same kinds of fear recur across four opened readings (the five weeks, the November night, the silence toward the Hart, Laura's handover) and the same kinds of love across two (the rebuild, the desk); fixing them as the lens's children keeps every later opening on one vocabulary.

Source: Round 8 openings.","data":{"schema":"meaning-model-lens/v1","id":"fear-love","name":"Fear or love","question":"Is what {subject} does primarily out of fear or out of love?","appliesTo":["act"],"answers":[{"key":"fear","meaning":"Primarily out of fear: of loss, exclusion, being exposed, being left behind.","children":[{"key":"being_found_out","meaning":"That what they have hidden will be seen, and they with it."},{"key":"losing_what_they_have","meaning":"Losing what they hold: money, a home, a job, a place."},{"key":"being_left_outside","meaning":"Being shut out of the band, the family or the fire: exclusion, being left."},{"key":"making_it_real","meaning":"That acting, selling or saying makes the loss or the mistake real."},{"key":"harm_to_someone_they_love","meaning":"That someone they love will be hurt, shamed, or will go."}]},{"key":"love","meaning":"Primarily out of love: of the people and things they care for, or of themselves given to others.","children":[{"key":"for_a_person","meaning":"For a particular person: a partner, a parent, a friend."},{"key":"for_a_shared_life","meaning":"For the life they are making with someone: a home, a routine, the ordinary days."},{"key":"for_the_truth_between_them","meaning":"For honesty itself: telling each other everything."},{"key":"for_the_work","meaning":"For what the work is for: the people it serves, the craft of it."}]}],"why":"The same kinds of fear recur across four opened readings (the five weeks, the November night, the silence toward the Hart, Laura's handover) and the same kinds of love across two (the rebuild, the desk); fixing them as the lens's children keeps every later opening on one vocabulary.","source":"Round 8 openings.","perspective":"modeler","reading":"support","evidence":"model","status":"authored"}}

{"schema":"meaning-model-understanding-note/v1","kind":"lens","text":"Reason, alibi or recognition. In {subject}, is this inner account the person's own reason (what actually moves them), an alibi (a story they tell themselves in its place, which lets them go on), or a recognition (something they come to see that they could not see before)?

Why: The story's inner Events hold what moves Kieran, what he tells himself instead (at a hundred thousand it would be a surprise, and a surprise is not a secret), and later what he comes to see (the phone as all three clocks at once; the logoff as going to work). An inner lens can show the arc from alibi to recognition, and set his own reasons at the deposit (love for Laura first) against what they are doing. Compared only with other inner readings.

Source: Suggested by the operator in round 7: what Kieran tells himself, read against his own reasons.","data":{"schema":"meaning-model-lens/v1","id":"reason-alibi-or-recognition","name":"Reason, alibi or recognition","question":"In {subject}, is this inner account the person's own reason (what actually moves them), an alibi (a story they tell themselves in its place, which lets them go on), or a recognition (something they come to see that they could not see before)?","appliesTo":["inner"],"answers":[{"key":"reason","meaning":"What actually moves the person, as they know it: a want, a fear or a love they would own if asked."},{"key":"alibi","meaning":"A story they tell themselves in place of the reason, which lets them go on without facing it."},{"key":"recognition","meaning":"Something they come to see that they could not, or would not, see before."}],"why":"The story's inner Events hold what moves Kieran, what he tells himself instead (at a hundred thousand it would be a surprise, and a surprise is not a secret), and later what he comes to see (the phone as all three clocks at once; the logoff as going to work). An inner lens can show the arc from alibi to recognition, and set his own reasons at the deposit (love for Laura first) against what they are doing. Compared only with other inner readings.","source":"Suggested by the operator in round 7: what Kieran tells himself, read against his own reasons.","perspective":"modeler","reading":"support","evidence":"model","status":"authored"}}
